bt-module-load
==============

This package provides the Bluetooth HCI kernel module load script and
associated systemd service for Qualcomm platforms.

Files installed:
  - /usr/bin/load_bt_modules.sh   : Script to load/unload hci_uart kernel module
  - /lib/systemd/system/bt_module_load.service : Systemd service unit
  - /lib/firmware/qca             : Symlink to /bluetooth/image

The service uses rfkill to reset Bluetooth before loading the hci_uart module.
